  </defs>
  <rect x="30" y="20" width="175" height="86" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <line x1="30" y1="52" x2="205" y2="52" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="117" y="41" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">Account</text>
  <text x="38" y="70"># balance: double</text>
  <text x="38" y="86">+ withdraw(a): boolean</text>
  <text x="38" y="101">+ getBalance(): double</text>
  <rect x="245" y="20" width="175" height="86" fill="#fff" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <line x1="245" y1="52" x2="420" y2="52" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="332" y="41" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">SavingsAccount</text>
  <text x="253" y="70">- minBalance: double</text>
  <text x="253" y="86">+ withdraw(a): boolean</text>
  <text x="253" y="101">(mit Mindestguthaben)</text>
  <line x1="332" y1="118" x2="117" y2="118" stroke="#333" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr_as)"/>
  <text x="225" y="137" text-anchor="middle">extends</text>
</svg>
<ul>
  <li><code>Account</code> mit <code>protected double balance</code>, Konstruktor <code>Account(double balance)</code>.</li>
  <li><code>withdraw(double amount)</code> in <code>Account</code>: nur bei <code>amount &gt; 0</code> und genug Guthaben; Rückgabe <code>true/false</code>.</li>
  <li><code>SavingsAccount</code> erbt von <code>Account</code>, hat <code>private double minBalance</code>.</li>
  <li>Überschreiben Sie <code>withdraw</code>: Abhebung nur, wenn danach <code>balance - amount &gt;= minBalance</code>.</li>
</ul>]]></text>
